# Private agent configuration and internal research: stowed, not published.
# These stay on disk so local tooling keeps working; they are tracked in the
# stow repository instead. Build-critical files formerly under docs/ and
# .codex/ now live in schemas/validation-rules/, scripts/reference/ and
# rules/agent-boundaries/ (see .stow-README.md).
#
# Published on purpose: the root AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md, the crew's skill and
# its generated agent files (.claude/agents, .claude/skills, .devin/agents),
# and everything under crew/. `crew lint` keeps private details out of them.
# A person's own additions go in AGENTS.local.md / CLAUDE.local.md (both agent
# CLIs read those), the crew's live state in .crew/, their settings in
# crew.local.ini: none of these is ever committed here.
/.claude/*
!/.claude/agents/
!/.claude/skills/
/.codex/
/.crew/
/crew.local.ini
/AGENT.md
/AGENTS.local.md
/CLAUDE.local.md
/FORM_BUILD_PRIORITY.md
/HANDOVER_HTML_ONLY_EBIRFORMS_2026-07-19.md
/api_integration_plan.md
/form_scaffold.md
/handoff.md
/macos-handoff.md
/prioritized_form.md
/steps.md
/.stow-README.md

.keys/
*.p8
.archives

# Regenerable intermediates from a local formgen run. Generated/corrected HTML
# and tools/formgen live in hexuria/buwiz-forms-html. This product repo keeps
# only html-frozen/ for fill/print.
/build/
/forms/
/forms-corrected/
/forms-corrected.manifest.json
.ci-html/
/assets/form-renderer-build-identity.json

# NSH app (nsh/): its own cargo workspace keeps its lockfile; generated files stay out.
!/nsh/Cargo.lock
/nsh/.nsh/
/nsh/target/
# Real-window screenshots go to ~/BuwizNsh/evidence/, never into the worktree (nsh test --target writes PNGs into the current directory).
/nsh/*.png

# The iOS App Store provisioning profile: kept outside the repository and copied in at build time (docs/platforms/ios.md).
assets/ios/embedded.mobileprovision
